# Section authoring

## File checklist

1. Name: `SectionName.astro` matching `_orbi.component` exactly
2. `interface Props` with **`locale: Locale`** required
3. Optional CMS fields typed with `?` — CMS may omit keys
4. User strings via `translate(field, locale)`
5. HTML bodies via **`<SafeHtml html={translate(content, locale)} />`** — never raw `set:html` on CMS input

## Props pattern

```astro
---
import type { Locale } from "~/config/locales"
import { translate } from "~/lib/i18n"
import type { I18nString } from "~/types/i18n"

interface Props {
  title?: I18nString
  locale: Locale
}

const { title, locale } = Astro.props
const heading = translate(title, locale)
---
```

## Styling

- Tailwind utility classes in markup
- **No `@apply` in `<style>` blocks** — use `src/styles/global.css` (ADR-0008)
- No hardcoded hex colours — use theme tokens (`text-brand-500`, etc.)

## Do not

- Import `~/lib/orbitype/*` or fetch in sections
- Add `client:*` without explicit performance justification
- Assume arrays exist — default with `?? []` before `.map()`

Unknown section types fall through to `DebugPanel` — fix the component name or add the file.
